# Build context for apps/agent-runtime/Dockerfile, which is built from the repo root
# (`fly deploy --config apps/agent-runtime/fly.toml --dockerfile apps/agent-runtime/Dockerfile .`).
# The image needs only the workspace manifests (package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml,
# pnpm-workspace.yaml, .npmrc), apps/agent-runtime and packages/*. Everything else stays
# out: secrets, git history, the other apps and the docs (audit M26). pnpm install
# --frozen-lockfile tolerates the absent workspace members (verified with pnpm 9.15).
.git
.claude
.github
**/node_modules
**/.env*
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
docs
apps/web
apps/mobile
launch
loadtest
tests
